OL,3,GNEWSAResearch highlights football
OL,4,Ateams' historic links
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo football team's long-standing
OL,7,Fconnection to the industrial heritage
OL,8,Fof the North East have been showcased
OL,9,Fat a conference in Spain.
OL,11,FUniversity of Sheffield Research
OL,12,FAssociate Dr Tosh Warwick presented
OL,13,Fresearch on the links between industry,
OL,14,FSunderland AFC's Stadium of Light and
OL,15,FMiddlesbrough's Riverside Stadium at
OL,16,Fthe INCUNA International Conference on
OL,17,FIndustrial Heritage in Gijon.
OL,19,FThe historian revealed how the football
OL,20,Fclubs had helped preserve memories of
OL,21,Fsteel, mining and other industries at
OL,22,Fthe heart of Teesside and Wearside.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
